caption: Repeated Parries
tradition-component: repeated-parries

Any Gaoshou Style may purchase Enhanced Parry (Repeated Parries Only, -40%) [3/level], specialized to Bare Hands or one Style Melee Weapon skill. It only offsets cumulative repeated-parry penalties; it never improves the first parry or raises a later parry above the ordinary unpenalized score. This permission is separate from Cultivation and is not subject to Cultivation's one-level ordinary Enhanced Parry cap.
